      "text": "Trigger A creature within 100 feet casts an acid, cold, fire, electricity, or poison spell, or such a spell otherwise comes into effect from a source within 100 feet\n\n---\n\nEffect The manifestation of Dahak makes all the choices to determine the targets, destination, or other effects of the spell, as though it were the caster."
