      "name": "Manipulate Energy",
      "actions": 1,
      "category": "offensive",
      "traits": [
        "concentrate",
        "divine"
      ],
      "text": "The manifestation attempts to take control of a magical acid, cold, electricity, fire, or poison spell within 100 feet. If it succeeds at a counteract check (counteract rank 10, counteract modifier +36), the original caster loses control of the spell, control is transferred to the manifestation, and the manifestation counts as having Sustained the Spell with this action (if applicable). The manifestation can end the spell instead of taking control, if it chooses."
